{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Hearth Defense</i> is a fast-paced top-down <strong>Tower Defense</strong> game where your mission is to protect the final hearth of civilization from waves of quirky \u2014 yet ruthless \u2014 monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one side, swarms of prehistoric beasts and fantastical creatures approach. On the other, brave knights, sharpshooting archers, powerful mages, and other heroes rise to defend humanity\u2019s last stronghold. Strategically place your defenders, build your defense line, upgrade your units, and stop the enemy before they extinguish the final hope of mankind \u2014 <strong>The Last Hearth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission in this game is to</strong> outwit, outmaneuver, and outlast the enemy waves using smart tactics and powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic tower defense gameplay with a distinct visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of defenders with upgrade paths and unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemy types \u2014 from goofy dinosaurs to terrifying beasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with deep, addictive strategic mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you hold the line and protect the Last Hearth?<br>Take on the challenge in <i>The Last Hearth Defense</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765800?t=1750740590","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765800?t=1750740590","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765800/828587dedf166ed68eeb09c0eb277903271eec56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750740590","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765800/828587dedf166ed68eeb09c0eb277903271eec56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750740590","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Hearth Defense</i> is a fast-paced top-down <strong>Tower Defense</strong> game where your mission is to protect the final hearth of civilization from waves of quirky \u2014 yet ruthless \u2014 monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one side, swarms of prehistoric beasts and fantastical creatures approach. On the other, brave knights, sharpshooting archers, powerful mages, and other heroes rise to defend humanity\u2019s last stronghold. Strategically place your defenders, build your defense line, upgrade your units, and stop the enemy before they extinguish the final hope of mankind \u2014 <strong>The Last Hearth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission in this game is to</strong> outwit, outmaneuver, and outlast the enemy waves using smart tactics and powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic tower defense gameplay with a distinct visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of defenders with upgrade paths and unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemy types \u2014 from goofy dinosaurs to terrifying beasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with deep, addictive strategic mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you hold the line and protect the Last Hearth?<br>Take on the challenge in <i>The Last Hearth Defense</i>!</p>","developers":["Quacky Vhalee LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap